### Register
POST http://localhost:5270/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "Test@12345"
}

###

### Login
POST http://localhost:5270/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "Test@12345"
}

###

### Get Documents (Authenticated)
@token = PASTE_FRESH_LOGIN_TOKEN_HERE

GET http://localhost:5270/api/Documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}